                <p><strong>Legal record:</strong> <span class="court-badge">✔ ZERO arrests, ZERO criminal charges, ZERO convictions</span> — “Last ticket was 2017, rolled a stop sign, got it dismissed via trial by declaration before I knew any of this.”</p>
                <p><strong>Early work:</strong> Taco Bell, then car flipping with Mike Riffett (hundreds of Fox-body Mustangs, Broncos). Learned sales by knocking on doors for abandoned cars.</p>
                <p><strong>Career:</strong> Built dental offices with Dr. Paul Alperstein (8 years, Cerritos CA). Previously built dental offices in NYC after meeting a dentist on the street (60 girls a day approach).</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p><strong>Scientology:</strong> Class V Auditor (internship nearly complete), Gold Sealed Ethics Specialist. “Highest trained in the world. Study tech is how I learned to look up every word — couldn’t read before.”</p>
                <p><strong>Infinite money mentor:</strong> Dan Peña (Trillion Dollar Man) — “everything free down the line, only charge for major litigation.”</p>
                <p><strong>Personal:</strong> Motorcycles, fast cars (2009 Shelby GT500), whiskey, women. “I used to stop 60 girls a day in NYC just to break out of my shell.”</p>
                <p><strong>Why free?</strong> “Karma is currency. If the country goes to shit, money doesn’t matter. I’m scared for America’s future.”</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

